Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.10,0:23:01.36,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし良いとこないよ
